end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere we have defined $a=$ {{field-3}}, which is an integer." :question/worked-solution "An integer is *even* if it can be written as $2a,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is even since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =8r+12 \\\\  & =2(\\underbrace{4r+6}_{a}) \\\\  & =2a,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere we have defined $a=4r+6,$ which is an integer."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406632 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171925 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ba331138-93b8-5fb0-918b-17dc6d3e4029" :knowledge-point/title "Showing a Linear Expression Is Even"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32ddb05c-f6d5-5a3d-99aa-4e98008a3666" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406592} {:answer/id #uuid "ea6b248b-7e82-5b5d-8552-fb0acf1f0499" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12-15p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406616} {:answer/id #uuid "f45d0236-6618-5132-bece-b7fce85de9a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12+15p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406617}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ea6b248b-7e82-5b5d-8552-fb0acf1f0499" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12-15p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406616} :answer-field/id #uuid "98b93fad-b428-5eaa-9a87-e604196a8bfc" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406625} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "026880e2-e551-5990-8bbd-db4f549c4604" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12-15p" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406583} {:answer/id #uuid "2abdb860-a6e4-51e1-a44e-f2025e141470" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :ans