\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =24-30p \\\\  & =2({{field-1}}) \\\\  & ={{field-2}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere we have defined $a=$ {{field-3}}, which is an integer." :question/worked-solution "An integer is *even* if it can be written as $2a,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is even since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =24-30p \\\\  & =2(\\underbrace{12-15p}_{a}) \\\\  & =2a,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere we have defined $a=12-15p,$ which is an integer."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186406633 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171925 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ba331138-93b8-5fb0-918b-17dc6d3e4029" :knowledge-point/title "Showing a Linear Expression Is Even"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e9dd801-60e0-5c97-b846-0b12517046b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3p-14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406587} {:answer/id #uuid "90143524-9620-5b4b-bea4-e126a616f687" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3p+7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406606} {:answer/id #uuid "ba0acdb8-64e5-5e47-9880-d4fb839bfb4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3p-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406608}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ba0acdb8-64e5-5e47-9880-d4fb839bfb4a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3p-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406608} :answer-field/id #uuid "140484ee-1073-56ec-8cf7-c80d2cf1a293" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406621} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "814163d3-804a-5695-ad97-b447d419a995" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2a-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406601} {:answer/id #uuid "b15c43d9-60aa-5f5