swer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407086}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "2f34688d-9a70-5e5f-86f3-8ad4e9bec34c" :question/math-academy-id "q-184062" :question/problem "Suppose $n=4i+2j-8,$ where $i,j\\in Z.$ Complete the following argument.\n\nThe number $n$ is {{field-1}} since \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =4i+2j-8 \\\\  & =2({{field-2}}-4) \\\\  & ={{field-3}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $a=${{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "An integer is *even* if it can be written as $2a,$ where $a$ is an integer.\n\nNotice that all terms in the expression $4i+2j-8$ have a common factor of $2.$ \n\nTherefore, we complete our argument as follows:\n\nThe number $n$ is $\\text{even}$ since\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}n & =4i+2j-8 \\\\  & =2(\\underbrace{2i+j-4}_{a}) \\\\  & =2a,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $a=2i+j-4\\in Z.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186407094 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171925 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ba331138-93b8-5fb0-918b-17dc6d3e4029" :knowledge-point/title "Showing a Linear Expression Is Even"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "10a6a47a-33d5-5bed-8a8d-7bef18cbabf6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m+4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186406993} {:answer/id #uuid "686571cc-efdf-579d-9ef1-4ec16b544d68" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407017} {:answer/id #uuid "84b2ca94-8ca7-5027-9aeb-dff194b65b21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "84b2ca94-8ca7-5027-9aeb-dff194b65b21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5m+2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186407027} :answer-field/id #uuid "0e2b1b9d-33b9-57e1-a556-83d02d