/ref 17592186453780} {:answer/id #uuid "b9562326-6917-5b9b-8891-e69c852ad350" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453781}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e23be71e-852a-5940-b70b-94df86be631d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453780} :answer-field/id #uuid "6c87eaa8-597e-5f60-bf52-0bb03b1cc589" :answer-field/key "IV" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454640}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "bd31a8b1-49f0-5bbe-9bfb-4daa99eb8e90" :question/math-academy-id "q-216328" :question/problem "$\\,$ If $P$ and $Q$ are congruent triangles, then $P$ and $Q$ have the same area.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the implication above?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles is a **necessary** condition for $P$ and $Q$ having the same area\n- **II.** $P$ and $Q$ having the same area is a **necessary** condition for $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles\n- **III.** $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles is a **sufficient** condition for $P$ and $Q$ having the same area\n- **IV.** $P$ and $Q$ having the same area is a **sufficient** condition for $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles" :question/worked-solution "Given that the implication $S⇒N$ is true, we have the following:\n\n- $S$ being true *guarantees* that $N$ must also be true. Therefore, $S$ is a *sufficient condition* for $N.$\n\n- For $S$ to be true, it is *necessary* that $N$ is true. Therefore, $N$ is a *necessary condition* for $S.$ However, note that $N$ being true does *not* guarantee that $S$ is true.\n\nThese ideas can be summarized as follows:\n\n$$\n\\text{S}\\text{ufficient}\\,⇒\\,\\text{N}\\text{ecessary}.\n$$\n\n  \n\nIn our case, \n\n$$\n\\underbrace{(\\,P\\text{ and }Q\\text{ are congruent triangles}\\,)}_{\\text{sufficient}}\\,⇒\\,\\underbrace{(\\,P\\text{ and }Q\\text{ have the same area}\\,)}_{\\text{necessary}}\n$$\n\nis a true statement. Therefore:\n\n- Statement II is true. $P$ and $Q$ having the same area is a **necessary** condition for $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles.\n\n- Statement III is true. $P$ and $Q$ being congruent triangles is a **sufficient** condition for $P$ and $Q$ having the same area.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186420705 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152076 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "6414abb9-00d3-55ea-a1e5-da99999c3ccc" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Necessary or Sufficient Conditions From Implications"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "249e2dff-033f-5340-b2d2-ea5b106a947b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453648} {:answer/id #uuid "7124ea30-3bdc-5464-9843-2ce2517fcf9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453649}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7124ea30-3bdc-5464-9843-2ce2517fcf9e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453649} :answer-field/id #uuid "2e121bcb-38e6-562e-95cd-1415caa73a9f" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186454574} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2226ea6e-d08d-51c2-b5c8-9e62a19f7a8d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186453650} {:answer/id #uuid "ccf5bfdb-49fb-5a81-8e16-3fd1354ee488" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "tr